# Cursor Rules for TailTools

Always adhere to the operational guidelines and rules defined in AGENTS.md:
- When the user asks for a plugin X, name it `CGE<X>` and put it in `plugins/CGE<X>/`.
- Create plans in `ai-todos/plans/CGE<X>-plan.md`.
- Create phase checklists in `ai-todos/todo-cheks/CGE<X>-checklist.md`.
- Always test plugins at the end of creation in `index.html`.
- Maintain complete documentation in `docs/CGE<X>/` (README.md, usage.md, examples.md, api.md).
- Generate universal AI skills in `.agents/skills/cge-<x>/SKILL.md`.
- Support both Tailwind CSS v4.3+ and Laravel (Blade & Vite).
- Write native JavaScript with `.d.ts` TypeScript definitions.
